msgctxt "1968_Date"
msgid "So I ended up buying formula instead. I'm glad at least\\r\nsomeone knows what they're talking about around here."
msgstr "Así que compré leche en polvo para bebés. Me alegra saber\\r\nque al menos alguien ahí fuera sabe de lo que habla."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1980_Kiryu"
msgid "Hm. I hadn't heard that before."
msgstr "Hm. No había oído hablar de eso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1992_Date"
msgid "I feel sorry for your kids, then. What kind of orphanage are\\r\nyou running?"
msgstr "Entonces lo siento por tus niños. ¿Qué clase de orfanato\\r\ntienes?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2004_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2016_Date"
msgid "Anyway, enough chitchat. I'd better get the formula ready!"
msgstr "Bueno, basta de cháchara. ¡Voy a preparar el biberón!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2076_Kiryu"
msgid "That's not quite right."
msgstr "Algo no me cuadra."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2088_Date"
msgid "Wait, what? I thought all babies drink milk!"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa? ¡Pensaba que todos los bebés tomaban leche!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2100_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah, from their mother. He's too young for cow's milk. You\\r\nneed to get him some baby formula."
msgstr "Sí, la de su madre. Es muy pequeño para la leche de vaca.\\r \nTienes que conseguirle leche en polvo para bebés."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2112_Date"
msgid "Oh, nice thinking! Thanks, Kiryu! Be back in a jiff!"
msgstr "¡Ah, bien pensado! ¡Gracias, Kiryu! ¡Vuelvo en un momento!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2124_Kiryu"
msgid "(I'd never have known that if Haruka hadn't told me. Good thing she's a smart kid.)"
msgstr "(Nunca lo hubiera sabido si no me lo hubiera dicho Haruka. \\r\nMenos mal que es una chica inteligente.)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2184_Date"
msgid "I got it!"
msgstr "¡Ya las tengo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2196_Kiryu"
msgid "Great, let's give him some."
msgstr "Bien, démosle un poco."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2244_Baby"
msgid "Waaaaah! Waaaaah!"
msgstr "¡Buaaah! ¡Buaaah!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2256_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2268_Date"
msgid "What the heck? Why won't he stop crying!?"
msgstr "¿Pero qué...? ¿¡Por qué no deja de llorar!?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2280_Kiryu"
msgid "I wish I could tell you."
msgstr "Ojalá lo supiera."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2292_Date"
msgid "Ugh, I could've sworn he'd calm down if we just gave him\\r\nsome food. What else can we try?"
msgstr "Ugh, hubiera jurado que se calmaría si le dábamos\\r\nde comer. ¿Qué más podemos intentar?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2304_Kiryu"
msgid "Hm..."
msgstr "Mm..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=6
msgctxt "2316_Kiryu"
msgid "(There must be some reason he's crying.)"
msgstr "(Tiene que haber alguna razón por la que llora.)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2328_Kiryu"
msgid "Have you checked his diaper, Date-san? It's a pretty common\\r\nreason for babies to cry."
msgstr "¿Has echado un vistazo a su pañal, Date? Es una razón\\r \nbastante común por la que los bebés lloran."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2340_Date"
msgid "Hey, that could be it! I didn't think of that!"
msgstr "¡Oye, puede que sea eso! ¡No lo había pensado!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=choice
#. y4:msg_decision_group=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_opcode=0x0111
#. y4:msg_branch_target=T0.P39
